<div class="pb-10">
  <header class="glass-header sticky top-0 z-40 px-6 py-4 border-b border-gray-200 text-center bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xl">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">RIFLE 急性肾损伤分期标准</h1>
  </header>

  <div id="rifle-app" class="max-w-md mx-auto">
    <div class="px-4 mt-6 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 px-2">血清肌酐 / GFR 标准</h2>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <label v-for="item in options.scr" :key="item.stage" class="block">
            <input type="radio" v-model="criteria.scr" :value="item.stage">
            <div :class="selectedClass(criteria.scr, item.stage)">
              <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium" v-text="item.text"></span>
              <span :class="scoreClass(criteria.scr, item.stage)" v-text="item.label"></span>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 px-2">尿量 标准</h2>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <label v-for="item in options.uo" :key="item.stage" class="block">
            <input type="radio" v-model="criteria.uo" :value="item.stage">
            <div :class="selectedClass(criteria.uo, item.stage)">
              <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium" v-text="item.text"></span>
              <span :class="scoreClass(criteria.uo, item.stage)" v-text="item.label"></span>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div :class="resultColor">
        <div class="text-sm opacity-80 mb-1 font-medium italic">RIFLE 分期</div>
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold mb-3" v-text="resultStage"></div>
        <div class="text-sm opacity-90" v-text="resultDetail"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-5 text-xs text-gray-500 space-y-2">
        <p><strong>注：</strong>分期取 SCr 标准与尿量标准中的较重者。</p>
        <p><strong>Loss：</strong>持续肾功能完全丧失 &gt; 4 周</p>
        <p><strong>ESRD：</strong>终末期肾病，持续 &gt; 3 个月</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400">ADQI Group, Crit Care 2004</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
